# Accounting: Contract validator (simplified)

Load examples/accounting/data/contract_review_packet.txt as Contract Packet
Alias Contract Packet as Contract

Find liability cap and save as liability_cap
Find payment terms days and save as payment_terms_days

liability_cap must be at least 1000000
payment_terms_days must be at least 30

If liability_cap is missing
  contract_status equals "needs review"
Otherwise
  contract_status equals "compliant"

Route contract_status to accounting_contract_queue
